## 🚨 MANDATORY SCRIPTS — DO NOT SKIP

> **CRITICAL**: You MUST run this script in Phase 8. DO NOT do manual analysis/validation — script catches what LLMs miss (12-section presence, Mermaid lint, cross-section entity consistency, numeric arithmetic check).

### Phase 8 — Pre-Consolidate Validation
```bash
node r-genie/Salesforce_Solution_Architect_Agent/lib/scripts/validate-solution-doc.js \
  project/output_salesforce_solution_architect/{scenario-slug}-solution-architecture.md
```
**DO NOT manually count sections, lint Mermaid by hand, or eyeball arithmetic. RUN THE SCRIPT FIRST.** Output goes to chat (validation report); fix any failures before final polish.

